   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "FF Resonance",
   "y": -560,
   "fontSize": 104
  },
  {
   "x": 0,
   "bgColor": "#0b1a3a",
   "bgOpacity": 0.0,
   "bgPadding": 0,
   "outline": 10,
   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "4,400 PLAYING. 0 REVIEWS.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 66
  },
  {
   "text": "Four thousand four hundred\npeople are in this Steam\ndemo right now. Two days\nafter it went up.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 5.322,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Zero reviews. And a\nmachine learning runtime\ninside the build.",
   "start": 5.572,
   "duration": 4.251,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what it is. FINAL\nFANTASY RESONANCE, the\nfirst HD-2D Final Fantasy,\nfrom the Octopath Traveler\nteam and a Tokyo\nco-developer called\nLANCARSE. The demo is the\nwhole of chapter one.",
   "start": 17.073,
   "duration": 12.323,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You summon Visions in\nbattle. Classic Final\nFantasy characters. Cloud\nshows up.",
   "start": 29.646,
   "duration": 5.453,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Unreal\nEngine 5, and one four\nhundred and sixty seven\nmegabyte executable with\nthe whole game linked into\nit.",
   "start": 35.349,
   "duration": 7.961,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Around it: ONNX Runtime\nand DirectML. An ML\ninference runtime, in a\npixel-art RPG. What for,\nthe file list doesn't say.",
   "start": 43.56,
   "duration": 10.573,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And the DirectX 12 debug\nlayer, shipped to players.\nA three-person team made\nthe same slip three\nepisodes ago. So does\nSquare Enix.",
   "start": 54.383,
   "duration": 8.77,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
